== Partner Derives Any Profit for Himself [Sec. 16] <16>

If a partner did anything with firms property/money/name/transaction, and the result:

- Is gain - must give the whole gain to the firm
- Is loss - must takes out of his pocket #footnote[The point on loss is not said in Section 16. Section 16 only talks about profit. It is there because it make sense.]

It also says that, if a partner carries on any business of the same nature as, and competing with this firm. This firm is entitled to all profit he made in that business.